  "description": "Young unlicensed doctor, Jiso Choi, learned medicine from his father. In little China, where law lacks presence, a triad leader asks Jiso's father to perform a FLC surgery on a beautiful woman. FLC is a chip that can make anyone fall in love with another by imprinting one's unique brain frequencies. However, Jiso falls into a dangerous love with the triad leader's woman and things get out of hand for him and his father...\n\nSource: Spottoon\n\nOriginally published on *Comico Korea* with an official Japanese translation on *Comico Japan* and English one on *Spottoon*.",
